{"name":"Igloo","hex":"#fdfcfa","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"igloo","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A dome-shaped Inuit shelter, constructed of blocks cut from snow.","A cavity, or excavation, made in the snow by a seal, over its breathing hole in the sea ice."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/igloo"}],"entries":[{"title":"Igloo","blocks":[{"text":"An igloo, also known as a snow house or snow hut, is a type of shelter built of suitable snow."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/Igloos.jpg/330px-Igloos.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Igloo","wikidata":"Q101805"},{"title":"Igloo (2019 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Igloo is a 2019 Indian Tamil-language romantic drama film directed by Bharath Mohan in his directorial debut. The film stars Amzath Khan and Anju Kurian, while RJ Vigneshkanth appears in a cameo role. The film was a ZEE5 original film and was released on 17 July 2019."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/d/d6/Igloo_%282019%29_Poster.jpg/330px-Igloo_%282019%29_Poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Igloo_(2019_film)","wikidata":"Q104843218"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/84/Inuit-Igloo_P.png/500px-Inuit-Igloo_P.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/84/Inuit-Igloo_P.png/1280px-Inuit-Igloo_P.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/84/Inuit-Igloo_P.png/500px-Inuit-Igloo_P.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Inuit building an igloo (1924)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AInuit-Igloo_P.png"},{"srcset":"https://th